@startuml F3.5-ERRO-sem-formative-review
title F3.5-ERRO — 403 sem formative.review
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Professor" as Prof
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "FormativeController" as Ctrl

Prof -> WebApp: /formativas?to=me
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /formativas?canReview=true
note right of Jwt
  formative.review ausente
  FormativeController não executa
end note
Jwt --> WebApp: 403
WebApp --> Prof: acesso negado

@enduml
